# Anchor — mindmate repo

Read `docs/Home.md` first. All project knowledge is in `docs/`.

## DOC UPDATE RULE (required on every code change)
Update the relevant doc before ending your turn:
- Training / data changes → `docs/Training.md`, `docs/Data.md`
- Benchmark changes or results → `docs/Benchmarks.md`, `docs/Models.md`
- Cluster / SLURM changes → `docs/Cluster.md`
- anchor-app changes → `docs/Anchor App.md`, `docs/System Prompt.md`
- Any bug fixed → `docs/Bug Log.md` (new dated entry)
- New work items → `docs/Next Steps.md`
- Any change at all → bump "Last updated" date in `docs/Home.md`

## Key invariants
- `finetuning/` scripts are current. Root-level scripts are legacy.
- Never continue-train (--adapter-path). MEMORY_USE collapses. Start fresh.
- Always `--gres=gpu:a100-80:1` in sbatch. H100-96 can fall back to 46 GB nodes.
- `--export` must go BEFORE the script path in sbatch.
- GitHub SSH blocked on cluster. Use rsync.
- Always 3-run averaged benchmark scores. Never rank on single-run.
- Base model beats all SFT on v3 (51% vs 44%). Root cause fixed in c3acdc9.
